WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.520
Hi, I'm Yuna. Start with a front-facing

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.980
view. Your brand chooses the next two poses,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:06.700
like

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.240
folded arms or a hand on your hip.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.040
Finish with a simulated back view, because unseen

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.600
details

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.320
cannot be predicted reliably, the back is an

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.720
illustration, not a verified reconstruction.

